\f0\fs24 \cf0 # AI Freelance Job Extractor\
\
A Python + Streamlit application that extracts structured information from freelance job posts using an OpenAI API, validates and cleans the extracted data, and stores the results in SQLite and CSV.\
\
## Features\
\
- Paste one or multiple freelance job posts\
- Upload a `.txt` file containing job posts\
- Extract multiple jobs using an OpenAI model\
- Validate extracted data using Pydantic\
- Clean and standardize extracted skills and text\
- Detect duplicate jobs\
- Display extracted jobs in Streamlit\
- Display input, output, and total token usage\
- Save jobs to SQLite\
- Save jobs to CSV\
- Search saved jobs\
- Download the cleaned CSV\
\
